OL,3,GNEWSAFears cathedral could close over
OL,4,Afunding crisis
OL,5,
OL,6,FMillions of pounds in repair works at
OL,7,Fone of Nottinghamshire's most famous
OL,8,Freligious buildings are needed urgently
OL,9,Fto prevent it from closing, according
OL,10,Fto church figures.
OL,12,FSouthwell Minster, a Grade I listed
OL,13,Fmonument, requires #20m of remedial
OL,14,Fwork, a letter to congregation members
OL,15,Fsaid, with the cathedral's roof leaking
OL,16,Fand houses in its estate deemed unfit
OL,17,Ffor people to live in.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
