OL,3,GNEWSAFears cathedral could close over
OL,4,Afunding crisis
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Very Reverend Stephen Evans, its
OL,7,FDean since April, said a backlog of
OL,8,Frepairs to the estate means "delay
OL,9,Fisn't an option", and is seeking
OL,10,Femergency support.
OL,12,FRobert Jenrick MP also raised the issue
OL,13,Fin the House of Commons last week.
